<symbol type="16" id="62" code="307" name="Uncrossable marsh"><description>A marsh which is uncrossable or which may constitute a danger to the competitor.The feature cannot be crossed. At least two blue lines shall be clearly visible. The symbol is orientated to north.

Minimum area: 2 lines.</description><combined_symbol parts="2"><part symbol="64"/><part symbol="63"/></combined_symbol></symbol>
